{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10104140","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10104140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1010414001:1":{"text":"やあどうも、ずいぶん疲れた様子だな、助けが必要か？","source_cn":"你们好，看你们很累的样子，需要帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9381FD7937B9568E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1010414002:1":{"text":"誰だお前は？この辺りは危険だって知らないのか？さっさとうせな。","source_cn":"你是谁啊？这附近不安全不知道吗？没事就快点滚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C8D59E5CD105C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010414003:1":{"text":"オイラはミスリル商会のロワンだ。屋敷の主に<style=\"highlight\">黄金の宴</style>に招待された。これが招待状だ。","source_cn":"我是秘银商会的罗万，庄园的主人邀请我参加<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x268A474B7C61322E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010414004:1":{"text":"客人の子供だろうが、ただの悪ガキだろうが、ここをうろつくんじゃない。","source_cn":"不管你是客人的小孩还是来捣乱的小孩，都别在这附近晃悠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F9ECACF6BCD415F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010414005:1":{"text":"俺たちは忙しいんだ、子守してる暇はないんだよ。","source_cn":"我们现在忙得很，没空逗小孩玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0311FB9424AC39AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male"